00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,367
Exam style.

2
00:00:01,367 --> 00:00:03,776
Your brother seldom writes to you, blank.

3
00:00:03,776 --> 00:00:10,729
The operator: writes has no auxiliary, and the subject is third person singular, so does.

4
00:00:10,729 --> 00:00:18,593
The polarity: there is no not, but seldom means almost never, so the statement is negative and the tag is positive.

5
00:00:18,593 --> 00:00:19,791
The pronoun: he.

6
00:00:19,791 --> 00:00:20,638
Does he.

7
00:00:20,638 --> 00:00:26,002
The student who ignores seldom writes doesn't he, and loses the mark.

